### ============================================================
### SYNAPSIS — Auth Integration Tests
### Prerequisiti: REST Client extension (VS Code)
### Server: http://localhost:3000
### ============================================================
### FLUSSO COMPLETO:
###  1. Register          → copia il token dalla console NestJS
###  2. Verify Email      → ottieni accessToken
###  3. Endpoint protetto → verifica con token
###  4. Refresh           → rinnova access token via cookie
###  5. Password Reset    → test flusso reset
###  6. Logout            → invalida sessione
###  7. Endpoint protetto → verifica 401 post-logout
### ============================================================

